        {
            "title": "Update",
            "date": "2018-04-28 16:32:45",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/2394103650896488666",
            "notes": "Multiplayer map in development\r\nThe GUI was fixed\r\nBugs fixed, some tasks simplified\r\nDownload from checkpoints"
        },
        {
            "title": "Update",
            "date": "2018-04-26 15:39:02",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/2394103650889126284",
            "notes": "*A new multiplayer map is being developed!\r\nGo to her with a friend. While it is empty, but we are actively filling it!\r\n*Corrected:\r\nBug with a gun on the second level\r\nA clearer one of the instructions\r\nBug with texture pictures\r\nAdded more fuel for the tank due to difficulties in its search\r\nThank you for your participation in the development of the project!"
        },
        {
            "title": "Update",
            "date": "2018-04-24 01:26:13",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/2758894130329225553",
            "notes": "Fixed: GUI(a menu in the game)\r\nStarted work on mulptiplayer\r\nAdded lobby\r\n"
        },
        {
            "title": "Dear players!",
            "date": "2018-04-22 13:15:06",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/2758894130323785284",
            "notes": "Our team sincerely tries to make the game better, putting maximum effort into it. Dear users,we ask you to take screenshots or describe the found bugs and send them to our mail realquesthelp@gmail.com so that we can correct them in time.\r\nSincerely, Your Stequer"
        },
        {
            "title": "Update",
            "date": "2018-04-22 13:00:41",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/2758894130323741137",
            "notes": "Fixed the following bugs:\r\n1. At the first level, the character could get stuck under the chain, now the chain is slightly reduced.\r\n2. At the first level, the hero, taking the box, could come up with him in his hands to the wall and let go, the consequence of these actions was that the object remained inside the wall. Now the box will shoot back, that is, the wall will push it. Our team is trying to eliminate the possibility of penetration of objects into the walls, but while we are in the process, so temporarily made \"ejection\" so that players do not lose items. \r\n3. Completely redesigned and changed all the clues on the first level.\r\n4. Fixed other small bags\r\n4. We were informed about some problems with localization(translation) into Russian, at the moment we are working on it."
        },
        {
            "title": "Update",
            "date": "2018-04-21 07:09:17",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/2758894130319246027",
            "notes": "Added support for the controller - control your favorite hero with the joystick!"
        }
    ]
